## Aggregators

### FreeModel

**Best for:** Cost optimization, multi-provider routing, China access

### Endpoint
```
https://api.freemodel.dev/v1/chat/completions
```

### Authentication
```bash
Authorization: Bearer fm-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
```

### Features
- Routes to 6+ providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, DeepSeek, xAI, Groq, Together AI)
- Automatic cost optimization
- $100 free credit + 1:1 match on first deposit
- China-accessible

### Pricing
- Dynamic pricing based on selected provider
- Average savings: 50-70% vs direct provider rates

### Python SDK
```python
from openai import OpenAI

client = OpenAI(
    api_key="fm-xxxxx",
    base_url="https://api.freemodel.dev/v1"
)

response = client.chat.completions.create(
  model="gpt-5.6",  # Will route to cheapest provider with GPT-5.6
  messages=[
    {"role": "user", "content": "Hello from FreeModel!"}
  ]
)

print(response.choices[0].message.content)
```

