## 🔄 Migration Guide

### From OpenAI to DeepSeek
```python
# Before (OpenAI)
client = OpenAI(api_key="sk-xxxxx")

# After (DeepSeek)
client = OpenAI(
    api_key="sk-xxxxx",
    base_url="https://api.deepseek.com/v1"
)
```

### From OpenAI to Together AI
```python
# Before (OpenAI)
client = OpenAI(api_key="sk-xxxxx")

# After (Together AI)
client = OpenAI(
    api_key="together_xxxxx",
    base_url="https://api.together.xyz/v1"
)
```

### From OpenAI to FreeModel (Aggregator)
```python
# Before (OpenAI)
client = OpenAI(api_key="sk-xxxxx")

# After (FreeModel)
client = OpenAI(
    api_key="fm-xxxxx",
    base_url="https://api.freemodel.dev/v1"
)
```

